        <mxCell id="boundary" value="After correction or a confirmed result, repeat the affected check. Unavailable evidence does not prove a missing certificate.&#10;Check whether the original operation ran before repeating it. Keep unresolved work on hold with a named owner.&#10;Public readiness does not activate a route. Keep other valid functions available. The matrix below links to the detailed rules." style="text;html=0;align=left;fontSize=14;" vertex="1" parent="1">
